/T (We issue a BUY recommendation for TLKM based on a potential total shareholder return of 31.3%, of which 24.5% are from capital gain to our target price of Rp 4,320/share and 6.8% from dividend yield in 2026E. Our target price is based on a combination of SOTP DCF-FCFF approach \(70%\) and EV/EBITDA multiple valuation \(30%\), and implies an EV/EBITDA 26F of 5.8x, a discount to international peers \(6.1x\). Our BUY recommendation is firmly supported by three main catalysts:)
