<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 99 0 R
/T (Our analysis yields a BUY recommendation with a target price of Rp 4,320, implying a 24.5% potential upside from the current price of Rp 3,470 \(2nd Jan 2025\). We utilize a 70% absolute valuation weighting via SOTP \(DCF-FCFF\), valuing Telkomsel, Mitratel \(MTEL\), and other subsidiaries with a target price of Rp4,310. This reflects structurally improving cash flow profiles driven by: 1\) a more rational competitive landscape facilitating price repair, 2\) 5G-led yield adoption, and 3\) aggressive business streamlining. This is complemented by a 30% relative valuation weighting \(SOTP EV/EBITDA\) with a target price of Rp4,340, serving to validate capital intensive industry.)
/E (Our analysis yields a BUY recommendation with a target price of Rp 4,320, implying a 24.5% potential upside from the current price of Rp 3,470 \(2nd Jan 2025\). We utilize a 70% absolute valuation weighting via SOTP \(DCF-FCFF\), valuing Telkomsel, Mitratel \(MTEL\), and other subsidiaries with a target price of Rp4,310. This reflects structurally improving cash flow profiles driven by: 1\) a more rational competitive landscape facilitating price repair, 2\) 5G-led yield adoption, and 3\) aggressive business streamlining. This is complemented by a 30% relative valuation weighting \(SOTP EV/EBITDA\) with a target price of Rp4,340, serving to validate capital intensive industry.)
