/T (Governance \(8.3/10\) With a score of 8.3/10, governance is characterized by an institutionalized framework that emphasizes effective board leadership, risk oversight, transparency, and regulatory compliance. Strong and Institutionalized Governance Framework. Institutionalized corporate governance supports effective oversight and long term value creation through clear structures and strong internal controls, led by a professionally composed Board with diverse expertise, including six of nine members from the private sector. Governance strength is further evidenced by full alignment with the ASEAN Corporate Governance Scorecard across key pillars \(Table 9\).)
/E (Governance \(8.3/10\) With a score of 8.3/10, governance is characterized by an institutionalized framework that emphasizes effective board leadership, risk oversight, transparency, and regulatory compliance. Strong and Institutionalized Governance Framework. Institutionalized corporate governance supports effective oversight and long term value creation through clear structures and strong internal controls, led by a professionally composed Board with diverse expertise, including six of nine members from the private sector. Governance strength is further evidenced by full alignment with the ASEAN Corporate Governance Scorecard across key pillars \(Table 9\).)
