/T (Regulatory Compliance in Competitive Conduct. Competitive behaviour is managed through regulatory compliance and internal controls. In 2024, no material legal cases or financial losses related to anti-competitive practices or monopoly violations were reported. Operational Risk Governance and Service Continuity. Risk management supports network resilience through continuous monitoring and coordinated incident response. In 2024, despite 3,927 fiber optic backbone disruptions, customer impact remained controlled, with Q disruptions at 3.59 and average repair time of about 6.2 hours, indicating disciplined operational risk oversight.)
